GREP - Grep Control
> _go  GREP OR 
    _go  [N] pattern  pattern ..
    _go  dir pattern  pattern ..

  ex.
  _go   1 func
  _go   1 else func 
  _go   /home/devg1120/solidjs-dnd-resize  else func

> _ga  GREP AND 
    _ga  [N] pattern  pattern ..
    _ga  dir pattern  pattern ..

  ex.
  _ga   1 else func 
  _ga   /home/devg1120/solidjs-dnd-resize  else func

>  _gs       grep current dir save
>  _gd [N]   grep dir stack delete
>  _gp       grep dir stack print
>  _ge       grep dir stack edit
>  _gr       grep dir stack reset
>  _gh       grep help
>  _ga       grep alias

